patrone-default-apps (0.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * No web browser comes with Patrone Linux: drop the dependency on
    chromium-browser (Chromium's snap). Until a browser's installed, web
    links open Patrone Browser Chooser, which asks which one to install;
    after that, whichever browser is installed (Flathub's, then the same
    browsers as snaps or their makers' packages) is the default.
  * Favorites: the browsers the chooser installs, and Chromium's snap,
    first; GNOME Shell shows the ones installed.

 -- William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0500

